{
    "name": "Aethersphere Harvester",
    "manaCost": "{3}",
    "typeLine": "Artifact — Vehicle",
    "oracleText": "Flying\nWhen this Vehicle enters, you get {E}{E} (two energy counters).\nPay {E}: This Vehicle gains lifelink until end of turn.\nCrew 1 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 1 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)",
